EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sorry,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}but I kind of
need some alone time right now.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Everything is OK. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}I just have a lot
on my mind.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Let's chat later.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Oye, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}me encantaría
quedarme a charlar, pero ahora
no es buen momento.
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Tengo muchas cosas que hacer.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Ya hablaremos luego.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Scusa, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ma adesso
vorrei stare un po' da sola.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Non è successo niente. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}È solo
che ho tanti pensieri per la testa.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Magari parliamo un'altra volta.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tut mir leid,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Aber ich
möchte etwas allein sein.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Keine Sorge, es ist alles in Ordnung.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich habe nur gerade viel um die
Ohren.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wir reden später,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ja?{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

EN:
I hate to do this to you,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}but could you come back and talk
to me later?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I just remembered something really
important I need to take care of
right now!{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

ES:
A riesgo de parecer maleducada,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿podrías dejar de hablarme
durante un rato?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}No puedo pasarme todo el día
de charla, compréndelo.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

IT:
Mi dispiace molto,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ma adesso non posso parlare con te.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Potremmo rimandare a più tardi?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Mi sono appena ricordata che
devo sbrigare alcune faccende
che non possono più aspettare!{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

DE:
Es tut mir überaus leid, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
aber könntest du später noch
einmal vorbeikommen?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Mir ist etwas äußerst Wichtiges
eingefallen, um das ich mich
umgehend kümmern muss.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

TRANSLATION:
Bunu yapmak istemezdim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}ama daha sonra gelip benimle
konuşabilir misin?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Az önce hemen halletmem gereken
çok önemli bir şey hatırladım!{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Je n'ai pas de temps à te consacrer
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Ce n'est pas le moment,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
j'ai des choses importantes à faire.
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ne m'en veux pas si je ne t'en dis
pas plus,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} mais c'est vraiment
personnel.{{TAG:000B:0005:03CD}}
